Goal: repair the bounded CI or workflow task described by the source GitHub Actions run and leave a clean working-tree patch. This path is only for work that falls outside the source PR branch's direct stabilization scope and was explicitly authorized on the source PR. Later workflow steps will create the repair branch, commit, draft PR, and apply the profile-defined validation label. They will not stabilize or merge that repair PR. Your job is only to produce the minimal repository changes and validate them locally.

